Distance: 1300 Conditions: All heats had more or less similar conditions. The BV heat had the strongest wind of the day with a slight chop. Breeze was a head&#45;wind at points and then a cross&#45;breeze. GV heat was the calmest of the day with a still breeze and minimal chop. Last race for Novice B was also similar with a slight wind and minimal chop.
